  "idea": "Krita: free open-source digital painting and graphics tool",
  "text": "How creators edit graphics, thumbnails, and concept art completely free. Paying thirty dollars monthly just to assemble YouTube thumbnails and promo banners burns cash unnecessarily. Online template editors compress your export resolution and lock essential clipping masks behind premium monthly paywalls. Krita gives you unlimited canvas sizes, smart selection outlines, text formatting, and lossless PNG exporting completely offline. You scale your creative output without recurring software expenses.",
